<title>USA: Covenant Bank sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Covenant Bank sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HADDONFIELD, N.J. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Covenant Bank said on Thursday it would issue a six percent stock dividend on December 16 to common shareholders of record on December 2.</p>
<p>The bank announced a four percent stock dividend in June.</p>
</text>
